  x `core/missing` is not a component
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-component/image.kdl:14:9]
 13 |     core {
 14 |         missing
    :         ^^^|^^^
    :            `-- nothing to build
 15 |     }
    `----
  help: give components/core/missing a manifest.kdl, a component.sh, a
        repo.sh, a packages.sh, a finalize.sh, a files/ directory, a
        Containerfile.inc or a file that another component collects, or define
        it inline with a manifest node such as `packages`

